        "Footplate Height Highlight Description": [.japanese: "ヒールデプス: シート面からヒールカップ(かかと受け)底面までの垂直方向の深さです。(平均値は10〜18cmです。)", .english: "Heel Depth: Vertical depth from seat plane to bottom of heels (typical average is 10-18 cm).", .german: "Fersentiefe: Vertikale Tiefe von Sitzfläche bis Fersenboden (10-18 cm).", .french: "Profondeur: Profondeur verticale du siège au talon (10-18 cm).", .spanish: "Profundidad: Profundidad vertical del asiento al talón (10-18 cm).", .italian: "Profondità: Profondità verticale dal piano del sedile al tallone (10-18 cm).", .chineseSimplified: "踵深度: 从座面到脚跟托底部的垂直深度（平均10~18cm）。", .korean: "힐 뎁스: 시트 면에서 힐컵 바닥까지의 수직 깊이(평균 10~18cm)."],
        "Footplate": [.japanese: "フットプレート", .english: "Footplate", .german: "Fußbrett", .french: "Repose-pieds", .spanish: "Reposapiés", .italian: "Pedaliera", .chineseSimplified: "脚踏板", .korean: "풋플레이트"],
